# Platform governance

- Repository documentation under `docs/` is the system of record. Chat history is not.
- `docs/platform-constitution.md` has **highest authority** among governance documents.
- Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/README.md` before implementing features.
- Joel owns product vision and approvals. ChatGPT designs and reviews. Cursor implements approved scope only.
- Every feature needs Feature Gate answers in `docs/platform-governance.md` before code changes.
- Do not expand scope without approval. Do not invent construction business rules.
- Prefer small, bounded changes. No unrelated refactors.
